    {
      "kind": "manual",
      "url": "https://www.fmicassets.com/Damroot/Original/10153/OM_StudioLive-Series-III-Console-Mixers_EN.pdf",
      "note": "PreSonus StudioLive Series III owner manual (PreSonus assets), opened 2026-11-12: rear panel connections (section 3.2): 8 XLR/TRS combo and 8 XLR mic inputs, 4 TRS aux inputs, stereo tape in and out (RCA), talkback XLR, 6 XLR and 4 TRS FlexMix outputs, main left/right and mono XLR outputs, balanced TRS monitor outputs, AES/EBU XLR output, AVB audio network port (locking XLR Ethernet, modelled as ethercon/aoip), control network RJ45, USB-B, an IEC power inlet (type letter not named: iec-c14 assumed, plan assumedConnectors power-in) with a rear power switch; front headphone output; lamp BNC and SD card slot are not modelled. Modelled: 4 of 8 combos (as their XLR half), 4 of 8 XLR inputs, 4 of 6 XLR FlexMix outputs. Generic artwork only (content/generic-panels/<id>.json, drawn by npm run asset:panel): connectors, faders, knobs and screens drawn without lettering, no photo, no logo. Every port and control position is a guess (confidence guess) and the side profile is an estimate drawn from the three outer sizes (no drawing opened). Connector genders not stated by the source follow the convention input = female, output = male."
    },
    {
      "kind": "datasheet",
      "url": "https://www.fmicassets.com/Damroot/Original/10154/TS_StudioLive-SE-16_EN.pdf",
      "note": "StudioLive SE 16 technical specifications, opened 2026-11-12: 6.51 in H x 17.59 in W x 22.97 in D (165.4 x 446.7 x 583.5 mm), 23.15 lb (10.5 kg). The sheet says \"12 (6 XLRM, 4 TRS)\" FlexMix outputs, which sums to 10: the manual table (6 + 4) is used."
    },
    {
      "kind": "manual",
      "url": "https://www.fmicassets.com/Damroot/Original/10153/OM_StudioLive-Series-III-Console-Mixers_EN.pdf",
      "note": "Phantom power (review fix, read 2026-11-12 by a research pass): the StudioLive Series III SE owner's manual (SE 16 I/O table PDF p.16, phantom PDF p.19) says phantom is individually switchable per microphone input: 16 mic inputs (8 combo, 8 XLR); the eight modelled ports are a subset."
    },
    {
      "kind": "photo",
      "url": "https://www.fmicassets.com/Damroot/eCommPNG/10110/2779200308_pre_aud_bck_1_nr.png",
      "note": "Rear, straight-on (assets-source/presonus-studiolive-iii-se-16/photos/rear.png, 3000x1207), 3D quality pass 2026-11-15: the io picture is the crop 66,62,2870,1140 of this photo (the black rear panel from the vent row to the feet), 2870 px = 447 mm and 1140 px = 165 mm, y from the bottom. Connector centres read on the 2000 px preview (+/- 10 px = +/- 2 mm): Mic 1 to 4 (top row, Mic 1 rightmost seen from behind, pitch 115 px), Mic/Line 9 to 12 below them (modelled as in-combo-1 to 4), Mono Sum (out-main-c), Main Output Right and Left, Talkback, AES Out, Mix 1 to 4 XLR, Monitor Out L and R, Aux 1 and 2 L and R (in-aux-1 to 4), Tape In and Out RCA, Audio Network etherCON (net-avb), Control RJ45 (net-ctl), USB-B, IEC inlet and the rocker at the left edge. Which catalogue id maps to which jack of the same family is a choice; positions are the photo ones, now confidence photo. The top picture is top.png turned 180 degrees (rear at the bottom of the face). The side profile (rear 165 mm, upper deck kink about 229 mm from the rear at 81 mm, front lip 22 mm) is read from side.png. Sizes and catalogue unchanged."
    }
